hangespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-px[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Closing an email task asks first (the Mail Close Card)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]No interactive gesture in Obsidian, bob capture, or Bob Mac Capture[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]can complete or cancel a Gmail Task without first showing one calm,[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]beautiful confirmation card that says whose turn the thread is on [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and what closing it will cost; a stray Enter, Alt+[, or [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]muscle-memory keypress keeps the task open.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]email_task_close_confirmation.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/email_task_close_confirmation.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-px[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-px/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared Gmail Task close model, vectors, and contract page [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF](bob-cli)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]model[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]model: Rust predicate plus copy and digest model for guarded closes, the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared conformance vectors, and the docs/mail-close-card.md contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture refuses unconfirmed email-task closes[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture: last-gate post-pass that finds Gmail Tasks a capture would [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close, the mail_close JSON payload, the -m/--mail-close DIGEST [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirmation, human output, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mail Close Card and guard API in Bob Navigation Hotkeys[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]navcard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]navcard: model twin, the card modal, nav api.mailCloseGuard v1, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guarding every nav-owned close path including review-walk landings.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task Status Cycler closes go through the guard[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cycler[dim] · [dim][/dim]after navcard[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cycler: guard Ctrl+Enter, Alt+[ / Alt+], counted, Task Link, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transclusion, Pomodoro-cascade, and offer-close writes with a sync fast [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, fail-closed fallback, and checkbox clicks.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture shows the Mail Close Card[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: preview banner, a Mail Close card opened from bob's refusal, Y to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirm with the digest, and docs and CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Cross-surface verification and records[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture, cycler, mac[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: replay the original accident on every surface, capture light and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dark card screenshots, and land the memory records the review accepted.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-px","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-px.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d11269c8035004663420465c805a7967","started_at":"2026-11-24T17:24:14.164753+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"f46a5c356e56d5a2c55f9b8a7fd0d83eebbcd2c54f6f105d48e150ce6fdecff0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3--2/chat.md","size_bytes":20876},"commits":{"digest":"1921908b9f13b39849f33fa15e62c9da3cfb01b928e039454769e166bec4fbfa","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3--2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"44e1cd5b5a7a1ee574caef138dcaeebe5fe580c44508798ef59e91777014aac6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3--2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":64},"meta":{"digest":"0238494a3561b0ba9d8505d28ac9e04e36917969cbf8c742b918b73b7d0670fb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3--2/meta.json","size_bytes":661},"prompt":{"digest":"8d0791cd7ed51a6c1db9a40e46f98a66b3c694771aea141aea6f80d3024c6b99","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3--2/prompt.md","size_bytes":7066},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"d70f10f0794bb41852b1f119440fe9ba15ac532b77165f5f549337a5214412f3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3--2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":2895},"state":{"digest":"456e5017bbf3a07cd4f350295c65b77a922abc8a8ff598f7a4d01d35f7f88aa5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3--2/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-24T19:22:11.895987+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3--2","local_name":"bob-cli-px.3--2","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-px","